                                "example_id": "0e893b5b-5397-4016-9901-fb78ae6be988",
                                "sense_id": "a8dffc15-5351-3ddf-ac40-1529c4ce9b85",
                                "text": "All the eyes focus on the harasser. However, the person affected, the harassee, is often left behind. The harassee is most often a second thought. Employers may say “don’t forget about the harassee”, or “we must check on the how the harassee is doing”, but that is insufficient."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a79f3187-6d54-40e7-9e0d-7b6e0e58885d",
                                "sense_id": "a8dffc15-5351-3ddf-ac40-1529c4ce9b85",
                                "text": "Ordinary people have already been face-swapped into videos for humorous or prank purposes and there is no reason to believe that abusers, harassers, stalkers, and blackmailers will not soon be face-swapping victims into compromising video as part of their arsenal."
                            }
                        ]
